---
description: Tauri / Rust conventions
globs: src-tauri/**
alwaysApply: false
---

- New command: add it in `commands.rs`, register it in `generate_handler!` in `main.rs`, add a typed wrapper in `src/data/repository.ts` that validates with zod.
- Commands return `Result<T, String>`; never panic on user input.
- Structs crossing IPC use `#[serde(rename_all = "camelCase")]` to match `src/contracts/task.ts`.
- Schema changes are new entries appended to `MIGRATIONS` in `db.rs`; never edit an existing migration.
- Data lives next to the exe (`woTask-data/`) when writable, else `%APPDATA%\woTask` (`paths.rs`).
